<HR>
<A NAME="_chap_40"><H2>((atikāram 40-kalvi))</H2></A>

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>

<P><B>(uri)</B> [aḵtāvatu, avvaracaṉ tāṉ kaṟṟaṟkuriya nūlkaḷik
kaṟṟal. aviyāvaṉa aṟanūlum, nītinūlum, yāṉi, kutiri, tēr,
paṭikkalameṉa ṟivaṟṟi ṉūlkaḷum mutalāyiṉa. aracaṉ
aṟivuṭiyaṉāyakkāl taṉṉuyirkkē yaṉṟi maṉṉuyirkkum payaṉpaṭuta
ṉōkki, iḵtaraciyaluḷ vikkappaṭṭatāyiṉum, yāvarkkum uṟuti
payattaṟa ciṟappuṭimiyiṟ potuppaṭak kūṟukiṉṟār. mēl `tūṅkāmi
kalvi' eṉattōṟṟuvāy ceyta māṭciyi virittuk kūṟukiṉṟamiyiṉ,
iḵtiṟimāṭciyiṉ piṉ vikkappaṭṭatu.]

<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0391"><H3>391</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>kaṟka kacaṭaṟak kaṟpavi kaṟṟapi
<BR>ṉiṟka vataṟkut taka.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>kaṟpavi kacaṭu aṟak kaṟka
<DD>oruvaṉ kaṟkappaṭu nūlkaḷip paḻutaṟak kaṟka
<DT>kaṟṟapiṉ ataṟkut taka niṟka
<DD>aṅṅaṉaṅ kaṟṟāl akkalvikkut taka
avi collukiṉṟa neṟik kaṇṇē niṟka.
</DL>


<P><B>(uri)</B> `kaṟpavi' yeṉṟataṉāṉ, aṟam
poru ḷiṉpam vīṭeṉṉu muṟutipporu
ḷuṇarttuvaṉavaṉṟip piṟaporuḷuṇarttuvaṉa ciṉṉāṭ palpiṇic
ciṟṟaṟiviṉarkku ākā veṉpatu peṟṟām. `kacaṭaṟak kaṟ'ṟalāvatu
viparīta viyaṅkaḷi nīkki, meypporuḷi nallōr palaruṭaṉ
palakālum payiṟal. niṟṟalāvatu ilvāḻvuḻik "karumamu muḷpaṭāp
pōkamun tuvvāt_tarumamun takkārkkē cey" taliṉum, tuṟantuḻit
tavattāṉ meyyuṇarntu avāvaṟuttaliṉum, vaḻuvāmi. ciṟappuṭi
makaṟkāyiṟkaṟṟal vēṇṭumeṉpatūum, avaṉāṟ kaṟkappaṭu nūlkaḷum,
avaṟṟik kaṟkumāṟum, kaṟṟataṉāṟ payaṉum itaṉāṟ kūṟappaṭṭaṉa.(1)




<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0392"><H3>392</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>eṇṇeṉpa vēṉi yeḻutteṉpa vivviraṇṭum
<BR>kaṇṇeṉpa vāḻu muyirkku.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>
eṇ eṉpa ēṉi eḻuttu eṉpa ivviraṇṭum
<DD>aṟiyātār eṇṇeṉṟu colluvaṉavum maṟṟiyeḻutteṉṟu
colluvaṉavumākiya kalikaḷiraṇṭiṉiyum
<DT>
vāḻum uyirkkukkaṇ eṉpa
<DD>aṟintār ciṟappuṭi yuyirkaṭkuk kaṇṇeṉṟu colluvar.
</DL>


<P><B>(uri)</B> `eṇ' ṇeṉpatu kaṇitam. atu karuviyuñ ceykiyumeṉa
iruvakippaṭum; avi ērampamutaliya nūlkaḷuṭ kāṇka. `eḻut'
teṉavē, ataṉōṭoṟṟumiyuṭiya collumaṭaṅkiṟṟu. ivvirutiṟamum,
aṟamutaṟ poruḷkaḷik kāṇṭaṟkuk karuviyākaliṉ, `kaṇ' ṇeṉappaṭṭaṉa.
avi karuviyātal, "āti mutaloḻiya vallātaṉa ~eṇṇi, ṉīti vaḻuvā
nilamiyavāṉ - mātē yaṟamār poruḷiṉpam vīṭeṉṟivaṟṟiṉ - ṟiṟamāmō
veṇṇiṟantāṟ ceppu;" "eḻuttaṟiyat tīru miḻitakimi
tīrntāṉ-moḻittiṟattiṉ muṭṭaṟuppā ṉāku-moḻittiṟattiṉ-muṭṭaṟutta
nallōṉ mutaṉūṟ poruḷuṇarntu-kaṭṭaṟuttu vīṭu peṟum." ivaṟṟā
ṉaṟika. `eṉpa' veṉpavaṟṟuḷ, muṉṉiyaviraṇṭum aḵṟiṇip paṉmip
peyar; piṉṉatu uyartiṇip paṉmiviṉi. `aṟiyātār' `aṟintā'
reṉpaṉa varuvikkappaṭṭaṉa. `ciṟappuṭiyi ' reṉṟatu makkaḷuyiḷḷum
uṇarvu mikutiyuṭiyataṉi. itaṉāṟ kaṟkappaṭu nūlkaṭkuk
karuviyāvaṉavum avaṟṟa tiṉṟiyamiyāmiyuṅ kūṟappaṭṭaṉa.(2)




<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0393"><H3>393</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>kaṇṇuṭiya reṉpavar kaṟṟōr mukattiraṇṭu
<BR>puṇṇuṭiyar kallā tavar.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>
kaṇ uṭiyar eṉpavar kaṟṟōr
<DD>kaṇṇuṭiyareṉṟu uyarttuc collappaṭuvār kaṟṟavarē
<DT>
kallātavar mukattu iraṇṭu puṇ uṭiyar
<DD>maṟṟik kallātavar mukattiṉ kaṇ iraṇṭu puṇṇuṭiyar, kaṇṇilar.
</DL>


<P><B>(uri)</B> tēya miṭiyiṭṭavaṟṟiyuṅ kāla
miṭiyiṭṭavaṟṟiyuṅ kāṇumñāṉakkaṇṇuṭimiyiṟ kaṟṟārik
`kaṇṇuṭiya' reṉṟum, aḵtiṉṟi nōy mutalivaṟṟāṟ ṟuṉpañceyyum
ūṉakkaṇṇēyuṭimiyiṟ kallātavarip `puṇṇuṭiya' reṉṟuṅ kūṟiṉār.
mēṟ kaṇṇaṉmi yuṇaraniṉṟa ūṉakkaṇṇiṉ meymmi kūṟiyavāṟṟāṉ,
poruṇūlkaḷiyuṅ karuvinūlkaḷiyuṅ kaṟṟāra tuyarvum
kallātāratiḻivum itaṉāṟ ṟokuttuk kūṟappaṭṭaṉa.(3)




<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0394"><H3>394</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>uvappat talikkūṭi uḷḷap pirita
<BR>laṉittē pulavar toḻil.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>uvappat talikkūṭi uḷḷap pirital aṉittē
<DD>yāvariyum avaruvakkumāṟu talippeytu iṉi ivari yāmeṅṅaṉaṅ
kūṭutumeṉa niṉiyumāṟu nīṅkutalākiya attaṉmittu
<DT>pulavar toḻil
<DD>kaṟṟaṟintāratu toḻil.
</DL>


<P><B>(uri)</B> tām nalvaḻiyoḻukal piṟarkkuṟutikūṟaleṉpaṉa
iraṇṭuntoḻileṉa oṉṟāyaṭaṅkutaliṉ, `attaṉmit' teṉṟār. `attaṉmi'
appayaṉittaruntaṉmi. nalloḻukkaṅ kāṇṭalāṉum, tamakku
matulamumuṟutiyumāya kūṟṟukkaḷ nikaḻvetirvukaḷiṉ iṉpam
payattalāṉum, kaṟṟārmāṭṭu ellārumaṉpuṭiyarāvareṉpatām. itaṉāṟ
kaṟṟāratuyarvu vakuttukkūṟappaṭaṭatu.(4)




<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0395"><H3>395</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
