<DD>araṅkiṉiyiḻiyātu vaṭṭāṭiṉāṟpōlum
<DT>nirampiyanūl iṉṟik kōṭṭikoḷal
<DD>tāṉiramputaṟkētuvākiya nūlkaḷik kallātu oruvaṉ aviyiṉka
ṇoṉṟaṉic collutal.
