vaṇaṅkāmiyum, muṭikkappaṭātāyiṉum karutiyatu muṭittē viṭutalum
mutalāyiṉa. aḷaviṟanta vuvakiyāvatu kaḻikaṇṇōṭṭam; piṟaruñ
