toḻilāṉum, ēṉiya mūvaki yāṟṟalāṉum kūṟupaṭuttut tūkkappaṭum.
`taṉvali' mikaviṉkaṭ ceykaveṉṟa vitiyāl, tōṟṟal orutaliyāya
kuṟiviṉkaṇṇum, vēṟal aiyamāya oppiṉkaṇṇum oḻikaveṉpatu
