`tammakiḻcciyi' ṉeṉṟum, ikaḻcciyuṅ kēṭum uṭaṉṟōṉṟumākaliṉ,
`makiḻcciyiṉ mintuṟum pōḻ' teṉṟuṅ kūṟiṉār. keṭṭāri uḷḷavē,
nāmum avvāṟē keṭutu meṉṟu ataṉkaṇ mintuṟāreṉpatu karuttu.
`eṇṇuka' <REF>maṇakkuṭavar</REF> veṉṟu pāṭamōtuvārumuḷar.(9)





