`kallārppiṇikku' meṉṟum, ēṉiya vaṟṟiyellām poṟukkiṉṟa
tiyalpākaliṉ nilattiṟkkup poṟi `atuvalla tilli' yeṉṟuṅ kūṟiṉār.
`nilak' keṉpatu ceyyuḷvikāram. itaṉāl veruvanta ceytaliṉ kuṟṟaṅ
kūṟappaṭṭatu.(10)


<HR>
<A NAME="_chap_58"><H2>((atikāram 58-kaṇṇōṭṭam))</H2></A>

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<P>[aḵtāvatu, taṉṉoṭu payiṉṟārik kaṇṭāl avar kūṟiyaṉa
maṟukkamāṭṭāmi. iḵtu avarmēṟ kaṇceṉṟavaḻi nikaḻvatākaliṉ,
appeyarttāyiṟṟu. mēl veruvanta ceyyāmiyuṭ kūṟiyavataṉiyē
ciṟappuppaṟṟi virittuk kūṟukiṉṟamiyiṉ, iḵtataṉpiṉ
vikkappaṭṭatu.]





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0571"><H3>571</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>kaṇṇōṭṭa meṉṉuṅ kaḻiperuṅ kāriki
<BR>yuṇmiyā ṉuṇṭiv vulaku.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>kaṇṇōṭṭam eṉṉum kaḻiperuṅ kāriki uṇmiyāṉ
<DD>kaṇṇōṭṭameṉṟu collappaṭukiṉṟa ciṟappuṭiyavaḻaku aracarmāṭṭu
uṇṭākalāṉ
<DT> ivvulaku uṇṭu
<DD>ivvulaka muṇṭākāniṉṟatu.
</DL>

<P>
`kaḻiperuṅkāriki'yeṉpuḻi oruporuṭpaṉmoḻi ivvuyiraḻakatu
ciṟappuṇaraniṉṟatu. ivvaḻaku ataṟkuṟuppākaliṉ, `uṇmiyā' ṉeṉa
nilipēṟuṅkūṟiṉār. iṉmi veruvanta ceyta lākaliṉ, avarnāṭṭu
vāḻvār puliyiyaṭinta pulvāyiṉam pōṉṟu ēmañcārāmippaṟṟi,
ivvulakuṇṭeṉṟār.(1)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0572"><H3>572</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>kaṇṇōṭṭat tuḷḷa tulakiya laḵtilā
<BR>ruṇmi nilakkup poṟi.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>ulakiyal kaṇṇōṭṭattu uḷḷatu
<DD>ulakanaṭi kaṇṇōṭṭattiṉkaṇṇē nikaḻvatu
<DT> aḵtu ilār uṇmi nilakkup poṟi
<DD>ākalāṉ, akkaṇṇōṭṭa millātār uḷalātal innilattiṟkup
pāramātaṟkē, piṟitoṉṟaṟkaṉṟu.
</DL>

<P>
ulakanaṭiyāvatu oppuravuceytal, puṟantarutal, piḻittaṉa
poṟuttaleṉṟivi mutalāyiṉa. avi nikaḻāmiyāl tamakkum piṟarkkum
payaṉpaṭā reṉpatupaṟṟi,`nilakkuppoṟi'yeṉṟār. ataṟkeṉpatu
colleccam.

<P><B>((++CODA)):</B>
ivi yiraṇṭu pāṭṭāṉum kaṇṇōṭṭattu ciṟappuk
kūṟappaṭṭatu.
<P><B>((++/CODA)):</B>

(2)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0573"><H3>573</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>paṇṇeṉṉām pāṭaṟ kiyipiṉṟēṟ kaṇṇeṉṉāṅ
<BR>kaṇṇōṭṭa millāta kaṇ.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>paṇ eṉṉām pāṭaṟku iyipu iṉṟēl
<DD>paṇ eṉṉa payattatām pāṭaṟṟoḻilōṭu poruttamiṉṟāyiṉ? kaṇ eṉṉām
kaṇṇōṭṭam illātakaṇ
<DD>atupōlak kaṇ eṉṉa payattakāṅ kaṇṇōṭṭamillātaviṭattu?
</DL>

<P>
`paṇ', `kaṇ'ṇeṉpaṉa cātippeyar. paṇkaḷāvaṉa: pāli yāḻmutaliya
nūṟṟumūṉṟu, pāṭaṟṟoḻilkaḷāvaṉa: yāḻiṉkaṇ vārtal mutaliyaveṭṭum,
paṇṇal mutaliyaveṭṭum, miṭaṟṟiṉ kaṇkaṭuttal, paṭuttal, nalital,
kampitam, kuṭilameṉṉu mintum, peruvaṇṇam, iṭivaṇṇam,
vaṉappuvaṇṇa mutaliya vaṇṇaṅkaḷeḻupattāṟumām. {{virivu
cilappatikāra vuriyiṟ kāṇka.}}  ivaṟṟō ṭiyiyā tavaḻip paṇṇāṟ
payaṉillātavāṟupōlak kaṇṇōṭṭat tiyiyāta vaḻikkaṇṇāṟ payaṉilli
yeṉpatām. kaṇceṉṟavaḻi nikaḻtal paṟṟi ataṉi yiṭamākkiṉār.
iṟutikkaṭ kaṇṇeṉpataṉik "kaṇṇakaṉñālam" {{tirikaṭukam-1.}}
eṉpuḻippōlak koḷka.(3)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0574"><H3>574</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>uḷapōṉ mukattevaṉ ceyyu maḷaviṉāṟ
<BR>kaṇṇōṭṭa millāta kaṇ.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>mukattu uḷapōl evaṉ ceyyum
<DD>kaṇṭārkku mukattiṉkaṇ uḷapōṟ ṟōṉṟalallatu vēṟeṉṉa payaṉic
ceyyum
<DT> aḷaviṉāṉ kaṇṇōṭṭam illāta kaṇ
<DD>aḷaviṟavāta kaṇṇōṭutali yuṭiyavallāta kaṇkaḷ?
</DL>


<P><B>((++GRAM)):</B>
tōṉṟa lallateṉṉuñ coṟkaḷ avāyniliyāṉ vantaṉa. kaḻikaṇṇōṭṭatti
ṉīkkutaṟku, `aḷaviṉā' ṉeṉṟār. oru payaṉiyuñ ceyyāveṉpatu
kuṟippeccam.(4)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0575"><H3>575</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>kaṇṇiṟ kaṇikalaṅ kaṇṇōṭṭa maḵtiṉmēṟ
<BR>puṇṇeṉṟuṇarap paṭum.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>kaṇṇiṟku aṇikalam kaṇṇōṭṭam
<DD>oruvaṉ kaṇṇiṟku aṇiyuṅkalamāvatu kaṇṇōṭṭam
<DT> aḵtu iṉṟēl puṇ eṉṟu uṇarappaṭum
<DD>akkalamilliyāyiṉ aḵtaṟivuṭiyārāṟ puṇṇeṉ ṟaṟiyappaṭum.
</DL>

<P>
vēṟaṇikala miṉmiyiṟ `kaṇṇiṟ kaṇikala' meṉṟum, kaṇṇāyt tōṉṟiṉum
nōykaḷāṉum pulaṉpaṟṟalāṉun tuyar viḷittaṉōkkip `puṇṇeṉ
ṟuṇarappaṭu' meṉṟuṅ kūṟiṉār.

<P><B>((++CODA)):</B>
ivi mūṉṟu pāṭṭāṉum ōṭātu niṉṟa kaṇṇiṉ kuṟṟaṅ
kūṟappaṭṭatu.
<P><B>((++/CODA)):</B>

(5)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0576"><H3>576</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>maṇṇō ṭiyinta marattaṉiyar kaṇṇō
<BR>ṭiyintukaṇ ṇōṭā tavar.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>kaṇṇōṭu iyintu kaṇṇōṭātavar
<DD>ōṭutaṟkuriya kaṇṇōṭu poruntivittu aḵtōṭātavar
<DT> maṇṇōṭu iyinta marattu aṉiyar
<DD>iyaṅkā niṉṟārāyiṉum maṇṇōṭu poruntiniṟkiṉṟa marattiṉi
yoppar.
</DL>

<P>
`ōṭātava'reṉpuḻic ciṉiviṉi mutaṉmēṉiṉṟatu. maramuṅ
kaṇṇōṭiyintu kaṇṇōṭāmiyiṉ, itu toḻiluvamam. itaṉic
cutimaṇṇōṭu kūṭiya marappāviyeṉ ṟurippārumuḷar.
<REF>((maṇakkuṭavar))</REF> aḵturiyaṉmi, kāṇappaṭuṅ kaṇṇāṉaṉṟi
ataṉuṇ maṟintu niṟkiṉṟa orucā ruḷḷīṭṭāṟ kūṟiṉamiyāṉum,
"marakkaṇṇō maṇṇāḷvār kaṇṇeṉ-ṟirakkaṇṭāy" 
{{ muttoḷḷāyiram.}}  eṉpataṉāṉu maṟika.(6)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0577"><H3>577</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>kaṇṇōṭṭa millavar kaṇṇilar kaṇṇuṭiyār
<BR>kaṇṇōṭṭa miṉmiyu mil.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>kaṇṇōṭṭam illavar kaṇ ilar
<DD>kaṇṇōṭṭa millātavar kaṇṇuṭiyarumallar
<DT> kaṇ uṭiyār kaṇṇōṭṭam iṉmiyum il
<DD>kaṇṇuṭiyavar kaṇṇōṭṭamillātalu milli.
</DL>

<P>
kaṇṇuṭiyarāyiṟ kāṭcikkaṇṇē aḵtōṭumeṉpatu paṟṟik `kaṇṇōṭṭa
millavar kaṇṇila' reṉak kūṟip piṉ ataṉi yetirmaṟimukattāṉ
viṟakkiṉār.
<P><B>((++GRAM)):</B>
ummi iṟantatu taḻīiya ~eccavummi.

<P><B>((++CODA)):</B>
ivi yiraṇṭupāṭṭāṉuṅ kaṇṇōṭātāratu iḻipu kūṟappaṭṭatu.
<P><B>((++/CODA)):</B>
(7)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0578"><H3>578</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>karumañ citiyāmaṟ kaṇṇōṭa vallārk
<BR>kurimi yuṭittiv vulaku.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>karumam citiyāmal kaṇṇōṭa vallārkku
<DD>muṟiceyta lākiya tantoḻilaḻiyāmaṟ kaṇṇōṭa valla vēntarkku
<DT> urimi uṭittu ivvulaku
<DD>urittāntaṉmiyuṭittu ivvulakam.
</DL>

<P>
tammoṭu payiṉṟār piṟari yiṭukkaṇceytuḻi avarik kaṇṇōṭi
yoṟātārkku muṟi citittal mēl "ōrntukaṇṇōṭātu" eṉṟa
muṟiyilakkaṇattāṉum peṟṟām. muṟi citiya varumavaḻik
kaṇṇōṭāmiyum vārāvaḻik kaṇṇōṭalum oruvaṟkiyalpāta larumiyiṟ
`kaṇṇōṭavallārk' keṉṟum avviyalpuṭiyārkku ulakamuḻuvatum
neṭuṅkālañ cēṟaliṉ `urimiyuṭit' teṉṟuṅ kūṟiṉār. itaṉāṟ
kaṇṇōṭumāṟu kūṟappaṭṭatu.(8)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0579"><H3>579</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>oṟuttāṟṟum paṇpiṉār kaṇṇuṅkaṇ ṇōṭip 
<BR>poṟuttāṟṟum paṇpē tali.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>oṟuttāṟṟum paṇpiṉārkaṇṇum
<DD>tammiyoṟukku miyalpuṭiyāriṭattum
<DT> kaṇṇōṭip poṟuttāṟṟum paṇpē tali
<DD>kaṇṇōṭṭamuṭiyarāyk kuṟṟattip poṟukkumiyalpē aracarkkut
taliyāyaviyalpāvatu.
</DL>

<P>
`paṇpiṉā' reṉṟataṉāl avarpayiṟci peṟṟām. `oruttāṟṟum',
`poṟuttāṟṟu' meṉpaṉa īṇṭorucoṉṉīra.(9)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0580"><H3>580</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>peyakkaṇṭu nañcuṇ ṭamivar nayattakka
<BR>nākarikam vēṇṭu pavar.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>nañcu peyak kaṇṭum uṇṭu amivar
<DD>payiṉṟār tamakku nañciṭak kaṇṭuvittum kaṇ maṟukkamāṭṭāmiyiṉ
ataṉiyuṇṭu piṉṉumavarōṭu mēvuvar
<DT> nayattakka nākarikam vēṇṭupavar
<DD>yāvarāṉum virumpattakka kaṇṇōṭṭattiṉi vēṇṭumavar.
</DL>

<P><B>((++LEX)):</B>
`nākarika' meṉpatu kaṇṇōṭṭamātal

<P><B>((++AUTHORITY)):</B>
"muntiyiruntu naṭṭōr koṭuppi
<BR>ṉañcu muṇpar naṉinā karikar" {{naṟṟiṇi-355.}} 
eṉpataṉāṉu maṟika.
<P><B>((++VIRI)):</B>
aracar avariyoṟātu kaṇṇōṭaṟpālatu tammāṭṭuk
kuṟṟañceytuḻi yeṉpatu
<P><B>((++CODA)):</B>
ivviraṇṭu pāṭṭāṉuṅ kūṟappaṭṭatu.
<P><B>((++/CODA)):</B>

(10)


<HR>
<A NAME="_chap_59"><H2>((atikāram 59-oṟṟāṭal))</H2></A>

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<P>[aḵtāvatu, paki, notumal, naṭpeṉṉum mūṉṟutiṟattār māṭṭum
nikaḻntaṉavaṟitaṟku oṟṟariyāḷutal {{39 mutal 58 atikāraṅkaḷiṟ
kūṟiyaṉa.}}  mēṟcolliya ilakkaṇattaṉāya aracaṉukkut taṉṉāṭu
celuttuṅkālum piṟarnāṭu koḷḷuṅkālum vēṇṭuvaṉa kūṟukiṉṟārākaliṉ,
avvirumikkum iṉṟiyamiyātāya itu muṉvikkappaṭṭatu.]





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0581"><H3>581</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>oṟṟu muricāṉṟa nūlu miviyiraṇṭun
<BR>teṟṟeṉka maṉṉavaṉ kaṇ.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>oṟṟum uricāṉṟa nūlum ivi iraṇṭum
<DD>oṟṟum, pukaḻaminta nītinūlumākiya iviyiraṇṭaṉiyum
<DT> maṉṉavaṉ kaṇ teṟṟeṉka
<DD>aracaṉ taṉṉiraṇṭu kaṇṇumākat teḷika.
</DL>

<P>
oṟṟut taṉkaṇ cellamāṭṭāta parappelāñ ceṉṟu kaṇṭu āṇṭu
nikaḻtaṉavellā muṇarttalāṉum, nūl annikaḻntavaṟṟiṟkut taṉṉuṇarvu
cellamāṭṭāta viṉikaḷiyellāñ colliṇarttalāṉum, ivviraṇṭaṉiyumē
taṉakkūṉak kaṇṇum ñāṉakkaṇṇumākat tuṇintukoṇṭoḻukuka veṉpatām.
oṟṟaṉi `oṟ' ṟeṉṟār, vēntaṉi vēnteṉṟāṟpōla. `teṟṟeṉka' veṉpatu
teṟṟeṉeṉpatu mutaṉiliyāka vanta viyaṅkōḷ. atu teṟṟeṉa veṉṉuñ
ceyaveṉeccattāṉaṟika. itaṉāl oṟṟiṉatu ciṟappuk kūṟappaṭṭatu.(1)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0582"><H3>582</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>ellārkku mellā nikaḻpavi yeññāṉṟum
<BR>vallaṟital vēntaṉ ṟoḻil.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>ellārkkum nikaḻpavi ellām eññāṉṟum val aṟital
<DD>ellār kaṇṇum nikaḻvaṉa vellā vaṟṟiyum nāṭōṟum oṟṟaṉ
virintaṟital
<DT> vēntaṉ toḻil
<DD>aracaṉukkuriya toḻil.
</DL>

<P>
`ellārkku' meṉṟatu mūṉṟutiṟattāriyum. nāṉkāvatu ēḻāva taṉ
poruṭkaṇ vantatu/ nikaḻvaṉa `vellā' meṉṟata nallavun tīyavumāya
coṟkaḷiyuñ ceyalkaḷiyum. avi nikaḻntapoḻutē avaṟṟiṟkuttakka
aḷiyākat teṟalākac ceyya vēṇṭutaliṉ `vallaṟita' leṉṟum,
avvirutoḻiṟkum aṟital kāraṇamākaliṉ ataṉiyē yupacāravaḻakkāṟ
`ṟoḻi' leṉṟuṅ kūṟiṉār. oṟṟāṉeṉpatu atikārattāṉ vantatu. itaṉāl
oṟṟiṉāya payaṉ kūṟappaṭṭatu.(2)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0583"><H3>583</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>oṟṟiṉā ṉoṟṟip poruṭeriyā {{iṉiyavi nāṟpatu}}  maṉṉavaṉ
<BR>koṟṟaṅ koḷakkiṭanta til.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>oṟṟiṉāṉ oṟṟip poruḷ teriyā maṉṉavaṉ
<DD>oṟṟiṉāṉē ellārkaṇṇum nikaḻntavaṟṟi oṟṟuvittu avaṟṟāṉeytum
payaṉiyārāyāta varacaṉ
<DT> koṟṟam koḷak kiṭantatu il
<DD>veṉṟiyaṭiyak kiṭantatu veṟoru neṟiyilli.
</DL>

<P>
annikaḻntaṉavum payaṉum aṟiyātu pakikkeḷiyaṉātal piṟitiṟ
ṟīrāmiyiṉ, `koṟṟaṅ koḷakkiṭanta til' leṉṟār. itaṟkuk
koḷakkiṭantatoru veṉṟiyilliyeṉ ṟurippiṉu
<REF>((maṇakkuṭavar))</REF> mamiyum. itaṉāl attoḻil ceyyātavaḻi
varuṅkuṟṟaṅ kūṟappaṭṭatu.(3)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0584"><H3>584</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>viṉiceyvār tañcuṟṟam vēṇṭātā reṉṟāṅ
<BR>kaṉivariyu mārāyva toṟṟu.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>tam viṉi ceyvār cuṟṟam vēṇṭātār eṉṟa aṉivariyum ārāyvatu
<DD>taṅkāriyañ ceyvār, cuṟṟattār, pakivareṉṟu collappaṭṭa
aṉivariyum coṟceyalkaḷāṉārāyvāṉē
<DT> oṟṟu
<DD>oṟṟaṉāvāṉ.
</DL>

<P>
`tam' meṉṟatu aracaṉōṭuḷappaṭutti. avaṉukkuk kāriyañ ceyvār
ceyvaṉavum, cuṟṟattār taṉṉiṭattum nāṭṭiṭattuñ ceyvaṉavum,
pakivar taṉṉaṟṟa mārāytalum mēṟ ṟēṟappaṭutalum muṉṉiṭṭut
taṉṉiṭattuc ceyvaṉavu maṟintu, avaṟṟiṟkēṟṟaṉa ceyyavēṇṭutaliṉ,
immūvakiyāriyum eñcāmalārāya vēṇṭumeṉpār, `aṉivariyu mārāyva
toṟ'ṟeṉṟār.(4)




<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0585"><H3>585</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>kaṭāa vuruvoṭu kaṇṇañcā tiyāṇṭu
<BR>mukāami vallatē yoṟṟu.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
