ivi nāṉku pāṭṭāṉum oṟṟiṉa tilakkaṇaṅ
kūṟappaṭṭatu.
<P><B>((++/CODA)):</B>

(7)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0588"><H3>588</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
