<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0589"><H3>589</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>oṟṟoṟ ṟuṇarāmi yāḷka vuṭaṉmūvar
<BR>coṟṟokka tēṟap paṭum.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>oṟṟu oṟṟu uṇarāmi āḷka
