<DT> uṭaṉ mūvar col tokka tēṟappaṭum
<DD>aṅṅaṉamāṇṭa voṟṟarmūvari oru poruṇmēl vēṟuvēṟuviṭṭāl ammūvar
collum payaṉālottaṉavāyiṉ, atu meyyeṉṟu teḷiyappaṭum.
</DL>

<P>
āyiṉeṉpatu varuvikkappaṭṭatu. oruvaṉiyoruva ṉaṟiyiṟ
ṟammuḷiyintu oppakkūṟuvarāliṉ `uṇarāmiyāḷka' veṉṟum, mūvarkku
neṭuñcoṟṟumippaṭutalum paṭṭāl nīṭu niṟṟaluṅkūṭāmiyiṟ
