<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0590"><H3>590</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>ciṟappaṟiya voṟṟiṉkaṭ ceyyaṟka ceyyiṟ
<BR>puṟappaṭuttā ṉāku maṟi.

