iḵtiṉṟiyamiyāmiyiṉ, oṟṟuṭaliṉ piṉ vikkappaṭṭatu.]



<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0591"><H3>591</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
