<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>uṭiyar eṉappaṭuvatu ūkkam
<DD>oruvari uṭiyareṉṟu colla ciṟantatu ūkkam
<DT> aḵtu illār maṟṟu uṭiyatu uṭiyarō
