ummi taḷḷāmi perumpāṉmiyātal viḷakkiṟṟu. taḷḷiyavaḻiyun
tāḷāṇmiyiṟ ṟavaṟiṉṟi nallōrāṟ paḻikkappaṭāmiyiṉ, taḷḷāviyaṟkit
