<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0599"><H3>599</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>pariyatu kūrṅkōṭṭa tāyiṉum yāṉi
<BR>verūum pulitāk kuṟiṉ.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>pariyatu kūrṅkōṭṭatu āyiṉum
