~aracarkku* añcuvar eṉṟu tōṉṟiniṉṟamiyiṉ piṟitu moḻital.(9)



<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0600"><H3>600</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>uramoruvaṟ kuḷḷa veṟukkiyaḵ tillār
<BR>maramakka ḷātalē vēṟu.

