<P>
`ura'meṉpatu aṟivātal "uraṉeṉṉun tōṭṭiyāṉ" {{kuṟaḷ-24.}} 
eṉpataṉāṉu maṟika. `mara' meṉpatu cātiyorumi. makkaṭkuḷḷa
nallaṟivuṅ kāriyamuyaṟciyu miṉmipaṟṟi `mara' meṉṟum,
marattiṟkuḷḷa payaṉpāṭiṉmipaṟṟi `makkaḷātalē vē' ṟeṉṟuṅ kūṟiṉār.
payaṉ: paḻamutaliyavum, tēvarkōṭṭam, illam, tēr, nāvāykaṭku
uṟuppātalum mutaliya.

<P><B>((++CODA)):</B>
