<DD>nītinūlkaḷik kaṟṟuc ceyvaṉa tavirvaṉa vaṟitalum
<DT> āḷviṉi
<DD>muyaṟciyum
<DT> aintuṭaṉ māṇṭatu amiccu
<DD>mēṟcolliya avvaṅkaṅkaḷintuṭaṉē tiruntavuṭiyāṉē
amiccaṉāvāṉ.
</DL>

<P>
eṇṇoṭu nīṇṭatu. avvinteṉac cuṭṭu varuvikka, annāṉkaṉiyum
mēṟkūṟiyavaṟṟōṭu tokuttuk kūṟiyatu. aviyu mivaṟṟōṭu kūṭiyē
māṭcimippaṭa vēṇṭutalāṉum, avaṟṟiṟku ainteṉṉun toki peṟutaṟkum.
<P><B>((++VAR)):</B>
iṉi, itaṉi īṇṭeṇṇiyavaṟṟiṟkē tokiyākkik `kuṭikātta' leṉpataṉik
kuṭippiṟappum ataṉi yoḻuppattāṟ kāttalumeṉap pakuppārum,
`kaṟṟaṟita' leṉpataṉik kaṟṟalum aṟitalumeṉap pakuppārumuḷar.
<P><B>((++FIGURE)):</B>
avar `uṭa' ṉeṉpataṉi muṟṟummipporuṭṭākkiyum, `kuṭi' yeṉpataṉi
ākupeyarākkiyum iṭarppaṭupa.(2)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0633"><H3>633</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>pirittalum pēṇik koḷalum pirintārp
<BR>poruttalum valla tamiccu.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>pirittalum
<DD>viṉi vantuḻip pakivarkkut tuṇiyāyiṉāri avariṟ
pirikkavēṇṭiṟ pirittalum
<DT> pēṇikkoḷalum
<DD>tampālāri avar piriyāmaṟ koṭi iṉcoṟkaḷāṟ pēṇikkoḷḷutalum
<DT> pirintārp poruttalum
<DD>muṉṉē tammiṉun tampālāriṉum pirintārimīṇṭum poruttavēṇṭiṟ
poruttalum
<DT> vallatu amiccu
<DD>vallavaṉē amiccaṉāvāṉ.
</DL>

<P>
ivaṟṟuḷ appoḻuti nilikkēṟṟaceyalaṟitalum ataṉi avaraṟiyāmal
ēṟṟa vupāyattāṟ kaṭippiṭittalum ariyavātaṉōkki, `valla' teṉṟār.
vaṭanūlār ivaṟṟuṭ porutalic caktiyeṉṟum, piritali
vikkirakameṉṟuṅ kūṟupa.(3)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0634"><H3>634</H3></A>
