maṟiyāṉēyāyiṉum
<DT> uṟuti kūṟal uḻiyiruntāṉ kaṭaṉ
<DD>akkuṟṟanōkki yoḻiyātu avaṉukku uṟutiyāyiṉa kūṟutal
amiccaṉukku muṟimi.
</DL>

