<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0639"><H3>639</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>paḻuteṇṇu mantiriyiṟ pakkattuṭ ṭevvō
<BR>reḻupatu kōṭi yuṟum.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>pakkattuḷ paḻutu eṇṇum mantiriyiṉ
<DD>pakkattiruntu piḻippa veṇṇum amiccaṉoruvaṉil
<DT> ōreḻupaḻu kōṭi tev uṟum
<DD>aracaṉukku etirniṟpār ōreḻapatu kōṭipakiva ruṟuvar.
</DL>

<P>
`eḻuvatu kōṭi' yeṉṟatu mikap palavāya veṇṇiṟkoṉṟu kāṭṭiyavāṟu.
veḷippaṭa niṟṟalāṉ avar kākkappaṭuvar, ivaṉ uṭpakiyāy niṟṟalāṟ
kākkappaṭā ṉeṉpatupaṟṟi, ivvāṟu kūṟiṉār. eḻupatukōṭi maṭaṅku
nallareṉṟurippārum, eḻupatu kūṟu taliyeṉṟu pāṭamōtuvāramuḷar
<REF>"eḻupatu kōṭitali" eṉṟu pāṭaṅkoṇṭār maṇakkuṭavar.</REF> (9)





