<DD>iṅṅaṉañ collutaṟku mēṟpaṭṭa aṟaṉum poruḷumilliyākalāṉ.
</DL>

<P>
attiṟaṅkaḷāvaṉa: kuṭippiṟappu, kalvi, oḻukkam, celvam, uruvam,
paruva meṉpaṉavaṟṟāṉ varun takuti vēṟupāṭukaḷ. avaṟṟi`yaṟintu
collu'talāvatu: avaṟṟāṟṟamakkum avarkku muḷavāya ēṟṟattāḻvukaḷi
yaṟintu avvam malapāṟ collutal. aḵtu ulakattōṭoṭṭavoḻukaliyum
iṉimiyiyum payattaliṉ aṟaṉāyiṟṟu; taṅkāriyamuṭittaliṟ
poruḷāyiṟṟu. aṟaṉum poruḷumeṉak kāraṇattik kāriyamākkik
