</DL>

<P>
piṟarcoṟkaḷuṭ kuṟṟamuḷavāyiṉum avi nōkki yikaḻāreṉpatām.
vallāriyikaḻtal vallunarkkut takutiyiṉmiyiṉ ituvu muṭaṉkūṟiṉār.

<P><B>((++CODA)):</B>
ivi mūṉṟu pāṭṭāṉum ataṉic collumāṟu
kūṟappaṭṭatu.
<P><B>((++/CODA)):</B>

