<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0661"><H3>661</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>viṉittiṭpa meṉpa toruvaṉ maṉattiṭpa
<BR>maṟṟiya vellām piṟa.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>viṉittiṭpam eṉpatu oruvaṉ maṉattiṭpam
