<DD>ārāyumiṭattu avarkaṇṇallatu piṟavilli.
</DL>

<P>
aṟiviṉuṇmi aḵtuṭiyārmē lēṟṟappaṭṭatu. iṅkitam, vaṭivu, toḻil,
colleṉpaṉa mutalākap piṟarkaruttaḷakkumaḷavikaḷ pala,
aviyellāmmuṉṉaṟintavaḻi avarāṉ maṟikkappaṭum, nōkkam maṉattoṭu
kalattalāṉ āṇṭu maṟikkappaṭāteṉpatupaṟṟi, ataṉiyē pirittuk
kūṟiṉār. iṉi, alikkuṅ kōleṉṟu pāṭamōti, nuṇṇiya meṉṟirukkum
amiccari aracalikkuṅ kōlāvatu kaṇṇeṉa vurittu, taṉ
vekuḷinōkkāl avar vekuṭaṟkuṟippaṟika veṉpatu karuttākkuvāru
muḷar.

<P><B>((++CODA)):</B>
ivi yiraṇṭu pāṭṭāṉum nuṇkaruvi nōkkeṉpatu
kūṟappaṭṭatu.
<P><B>((++/CODA)):</B>

(10)


<HR>
<A NAME="_chap_72"><H2>((atikāram 72-aviyaṟital))</H2></A>

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<P>[aḵtāvatu, aracaṉōṭirunta aviyiṉa tiyalpiyaṟital.
kāriyañcolluṅkāl avaṉ kuṟippaṟitalē yaṉṟi, ituvum vēṇṭutaliṉ,
iḵtataṉpiṉ vikkappaṭṭatu.]





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0711"><H3>711</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>aviyaṟin tārāyntu colluka colliṉ
<BR>ṟokiyaṟinta tūymi yavar.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT>colliṉ toki aṟinta tūymiyavar
<DD>colliṉ kuḻuviṉi yaṟinta tūymiyiṉi yuṭiyār
<DT> avi aṟintu ārāyntu colluka
<DD>tāmoṉṟu colluṅkāl appoḻuti yaviyiṉi yaṟintu ārāyntu
colluka.
</DL>

<P>
colliṉ kuḻuveṉavē, ceñcol, ilakkaṇic col, kuṟippuccolleṉṉum
mūvakiccollu maṭaṅkiṉa. `tūymi' avaṟṟuḷ tamakkākātaṉa voḻittu
āvaṉa kōṭal. `avi'yeṉṟatu īṇ ṭataṉaḷavi. atu mikuti, oppu,
tāḻveṉa mūvakittu. `aṟi'tal: tammoṭu tūkkiyaṟital. `ārāy'tal:
ivvakikkaṭ colluṅ kāriyam itu, collumāṟitu, coṉṉāl ataṉmuṭi
vituveṉṟu iviyuḷḷiṭṭaṉa vārāytal.(1)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0712"><H3>712</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>iṭiterintu naṉkuṇarntu colluka colli
