tuṇivali yiṉmiyuṅ koḷḷappaṭum. attuṇitāṉ paṭi poruṇmutaliya
vēṟṟumittuṇiyum, nallaṟivuṭimi nītinūlvaḻiyoḻukaṉ mutaliya
oṟṟumittuṇiyumeṉa viraṇṭām. avviraṇṭumillāri velvārkku
valitoliyāmiyiṉ avarōṭu pakittal vitikkappaṭṭatu. ciṅka
nōkkākiya itaṉuṭ pakimāṭci potuvakiyāṟ kūṟappaṭṭatu.(1)





