<P>
`cārpu':araṇ, paṭi, poruḷ, naṭpeṉavivi. aviyellām
vekuṇṭavaratu āṟṟalāṟ ṟiripurampōla aḻintu viṭu mākaliṉ,
`uyyā'reṉṟār. cīruṭiyatu `cī' reṉappaṭṭatu. itaṉāl
akkuṟṟamuṭiyār cārpu paṟṟim uyyāreṉpatu kūṟappaṭṭatu.(10)

