uyttuṇartal taḷarcciyāṟ kaḷippiṉi yuṇarntu
ataṉāṟ kaḷḷuṇṭatuṇartal.(7)





<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_0928"><H3>928</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>kaḷittaṟiyē ṉeṉpatu kiviṭuka neñcat
<BR>toḷittatūu māṅkē mikum.

