tīrāmiyiṉ aviyoḻittu, ēṉik kāraṇaṅkaḷāṉ varuvaṉavaṟṟit
tīrkkum maruntiṉṟiṟaṅ kūṟukiṉṟār. kāraṇaṅkaḷāvaṉa uṇavuceyalkaḷa
tovvāmiyākaliṉ piṇikaḷuṅ kāraṇattāṉ varuvaṉavāyiṉa.]



