<HR>
<A NAME="_chap_102"><H2>((atikāram 102-nāṇuṭimi))</H2></A>

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<P>[aḵtāvatu, mēṟcolliya cālpu paṇpumutaliya kuṇaṅkaḷāluyarntōr
tamakkovvāta karumaṅkaḷil nāṇutaluṭiyarāntaṉmi.
atikāramuṟimiyum itaṉāṉē viḷaṅkum.]



<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_1011"><H3>1011</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>karumattā ṉāṇuta ṉāṇut tirunuta
<BR>ṉallavar nāṇup piṟa

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT> nāṇuk karumattāl nāṇutal
<DD>naṉmakkaṇāṇāvatu iḻinta karumaṅkāraṇamāka nāṇutal
<DT> piṟa tirunutal nallavar nāṇu
<DD>aḵtaṉṟi maṉamoḻimeykaḷa toṭukkattāṉ varuvaṉavōveṉiṉ, avi
avaraḷavalla, aḻakiya nutaliṉiyuṭiya kulamakaḷir nāṇkaḷ.
</DL>

<P>
piṟa kulamakaḷir nāṇeṉṟataṉāṉ ēṉiyatu naṉmakkaṇāṇeṉpatum,
`nāṇuta' leṉṟataṉāṟ karumattatiḻivum peṟṟām. `tirunutaṉallava'
reṉpatu pukaḻccikkuṟippu. ētuppaṉmipaṟṟip `piṟa' veṉṟār. iṉi
aṟṟamaṟittaṉ mutaliyaṉa potumakaḷir nāṇō
ṭokkumeṉṟurippārumuḷar; <REF>((maṇakkuṭavar.))</REF> avarkku nāṇ
kēṭu payakkumeṉa vilakkappaṭṭamiyāṉum, avar peyarāṟ
kūṟappaṭāmiyāṉum aḵturiyaṉmi yaṟika. itaṉāṉ nāṇiṉatilakkaṇaṅ
kūṟappaṭṭatu.(1)



<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_1012"><H3>1012</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>ūṇuṭi yecca muyirkkellām vēṟalla
<BR>nāṇuṭimi māntar ciṟappu.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT> ūṇ uṭi eccam uyirkkellām vēṟu alla
<DD>ūṇum uṭiyum aviyoḻintaṉavum makkaḷuyirkkellām potu
<DT> māntar ciṟappu nāṇuṭimi
<DD>naṉmakkaṭkuc ciṟappāvatu nāṇuṭimiyē, aviyalla.
</DL>

<P>
oḻintaṉa uṟakkamum accamum kāmamum. `ciṟappu': avvuyirkaḷiṉ
vēṟupāṭu. accameṉṟu pāṭamō tuvārumuḷar.(2)



<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_1013"><H3>1013</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>ūṉik kuṟittu vuyirellā nāṇeṉṉu
<BR>naṉmi kuṟittatu cālpu.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
