<P>
uḻutaṉ mutaliya ceyvār yāvarkkuñ celvaṅkoṭuttu varukiṉṟavāṟu
paṟṟi `nallā' ḷeṉṟum, atukaṇṭuvittum atu ceyyātu
vaṟumiyuṟukiṉṟa pētimipaṟṟi `naku' meṉṟuṅ kūṟiṉār.
irappāriyeṉṟu pāṭamōtuvārumuḷar. {{maṇakkuṭavar.}} itaṉāṉ atu
ceyyātavaḻip paṭumiḻukkuk kūṟappaṭṭatu. varukiṉṟa vatikāra
muṟimikkuk kāraṇamumitu.(10)

 

<HR>
<A NAME="_chap_105"><H2>((atikāram 105-nalkuravu)</H2></A>

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>[aḵtāvatu, nukarap paṭuvaṉa yāvu millāmi]



<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_1041"><H3>1041</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>iṉmiyi ṉiṉṉāta tiyāteṉi ṉiṉmiyi
<BR>ṉiṉmiyē yiṉṉā tatu.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT> iṉmiyiṉ iṉṉātatu yātu eṉiṉ
<DD>oruvaṉukku vaṟumipōla viṉṉātatu yāteṉṟu viṉaviṉ
<DT> iṉmiyiṉ iṉṉātatu iṉmiyē
<DD>vaṟumipōla viṉṉātatu vaṟumiyē piṟitilli.
</DL>

<P>
`iṉṉātatu'-tuṉpañceyvatu. oppatilliyeṉavē, mikkatiṉmi
collavēṇṭā vāyiṟṟu.(1)


<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_1042"><H3>1042</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>iṉmi yeṉavoru pāvi maṟumiyu
<BR>mimmiyu miṉṟi varum.

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT> iṉmiyeṉa orupāvi
<DD>vaṟumiyeṉṟu colluppaṭuvatoru pāvi
<DT> maṟumiyum immiyum iṉṟi varum
<DD>oruvaṉuḻi varuṅkāl avaṉukku maṟumiyiṉpamum
immiyiṉpamumilliyāka varum.
</DL>

<P>
iṉmiyeṉa vorupāvi yeṉpataṟku mēl "aḻukkāṟeṉa vorupāvi"
{{kuṟaḷ-168}}  yeṉpuḻi yurittāṅkurikka. maṟumi, immi yeṉpaḷa
ākupeyar. īyāmiyāṉun tuvvāmiyāṉum aviyilavāyiṉa. iṉṟiviṭumeṉṟu
pāṭamōtip pāviyāleṉa viritturippārumuḷar. {{maṇakkuṭavar.}} (2) 



<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_1043"><H3>1043</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
<BR>tolvaravun tōluṅ keṭukkun tokiyāka
<BR>nalkura veṉṉu naci. {{mutumoḻikkāñci-6; 8}} 

<P><B>Parimēlaḻakar</B>
<BR>((WFW))
<DL>
<DT> nalkuravu eṉṉum naci
<DD>nalkuraveṉṟu collappaṭu māci
<DT> tolvaravum tōlum tokiyākak keṭukkum
<DD>taṉṉāṟ paṟṟappaṭṭāruṭiya paḻiya kuṭivaraviṉiyum ataṟkēṟṟa
colliṉiyum oruṅkē keṭukkum.
</DL>

<P>
naci yilvaḻi nalkuravu milliyākaliṉ nalkuraviyē naciyākki,
aḵtu akkuṭiyiṟ ṟollōrkkillāta iḻitoḻilkaḷiyum iḷivanta
coṟkaḷiyu muḷavākkalāṉ avviraṇṭaṉiyumoruṅku `keṭukku' meṉṟār.
"kuṭippiṟap paḻikkum viḻuppaṅkollum"  {{maṇimēkali, pāttiram
peṟṟa kāti, aṭi-76.}}  eṉṟār piṟarum. tōlāvatu "iḻumeṉ moḻiyāl
viḻumiyatu tuvaṟal" {{tol, poruḷ, cey-239}}  eṉṟār
tolkāppiyaṉārum. itaṟku uṭampeṉ ṟurippārumuḷar;
{{maṇakkuṭavar.}}  aḵtataṟkup peyarāyiṉum uṭampu keṭukkumeṉṟaṟkōr
poruṭciṟappillāmiyaṟika.(3)



<HR>
<A NAME="_kuRaL_1044"><H3>1044</H3></A>
<P><B>Kuṟaḷ</B>
